#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:45
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"On &Linux;, this information is read from <filename class=\"devicefile\">"
"/proc/devices</filename> and <filename class=\"devicefile\">"
"/proc/misc</filename>, which are only available if the <filename "
"class=\"directory\">/proc</filename> pseudo-filesystem is compiled into the "
"kernel. Devices are listed by group (Character, Block, or Miscellaneous). The "
"device major number is listed, followed by an identifying label."
msgstr ""

